01:27:29.100 --> 01:27:31.520
someone will find you...


01:27:32.650 --> 01:27:35.070
along with the photo of Donna


01:27:35.150 --> 01:27:38.490
and the confession that
I typed on your computer.


01:27:40.030 --> 01:27:42.240
Or...


01:27:42.320 --> 01:27:44.950
I have a special time,
limited offer.


01:27:46.290 --> 01:27:48.460
You step off that chair,
you end it all,


01:27:48.540 --> 01:27:50.670
I destroy all the evidence.


01:27:50.790 --> 01:27:54.290
No one will ever know
why you killed yourself,


01:27:54.380 --> 01:27:56.170
not even Janelle.


01:27:56.250 --> 01:27:58.510
I didn't kill Donna Mauer.


01:27:58.630 --> 01:28:01.010
- We've been over this.
- Fuck you. I'm not gonna beg.


01:28:01.130 --> 01:28:03.140
You mean you're not going
to beg again?


01:28:03.220 --> 01:28:05.180
Because you do it so well.


01:28:05.310 --> 01:28:06.680
Please.


01:28:08.060 --> 01:28:12.150
Please, pretty please,
with a cherry on top.


01:28:13.770 --> 01:28:15.940
One that you just had to pop.


01:28:19.360 --> 01:28:21.450
You'll leave a clue.


01:28:21.530 --> 01:28:23.660
You've messed up
once already,


01:28:23.780 --> 01:28:25.280
more than once.


01:28:25.370 --> 01:28:27.660
Mrs. Tokuda's made you.


01:28:27.740 --> 01:28:30.040
She's figured you out.


01:28:30.120 --> 01:28:32.540
They'll find you.


01:28:32.670 --> 01:28:35.210
- They might.
- No. They will.


01:28:35.340 --> 01:28:38.670
You'll spend the rest of your life
lookin' over your shoulder.


01:28:38.760 --> 01:28:41.970
Waking up, in the middle
of the night,


01:28:42.050 --> 01:28:43.800
jumping at every noise.


01:28:48.260 --> 01:28:51.730
How hard do you think
they're going to look for me, really?


01:28:52.730 --> 01:28:55.730
I mean, they find a pedophile killer,
all gift wrapped for them.


01:28:55.860 --> 01:28:58.480
Do you think they're going
to care who did the work?


01:28:58.570 --> 01:29:00.570
Do you think they're even
gonna bring it up?


01:29:00.690 --> 01:29:05.160
And I will have the biggest
legal defense you ever saw.


01:29:05.240 --> 01:29:08.910
If everyone who's ever molested
sends me $5,


01:29:09.040 --> 01:29:10.950
oh, come on, I'll be able
to afford


01:29:11.080 --> 01:29:13.210
the best fucking lawyer in the world.


01:29:14.250 --> 01:29:16.580
Worst case scenario:


01:29:16.670 --> 01:29:19.090
two years of community service?


01:29:20.300 --> 01:29:24.090
Jody Foster directs
the movie version of the whole thing.


01:29:29.760 --> 01:29:32.350
Who do you want to play you?


01:30:25.650 --> 01:30:28.490
You didn't leave, did ya?


01:30:28.620 --> 01:30:30.120
No.


01:30:31.830 --> 01:30:35.790
You don't wanna
leave me... do ya?


01:30:46.680 --> 01:30:48.340
Where are ya?


01:30:49.840 --> 01:30:52.560
We've spent too much time
only to walk away.


01:30:54.470 --> 01:30:56.690
I know you're not gonna leave.


01:30:57.850 --> 01:30:59.150
Come on!


01:30:59.350 --> 01:31:02.070
I'll make it good for you,
I promise!


01:31:47.940 --> 01:31:49.700
Oh, you're good.


01:31:49.780 --> 01:31:52.030
You're so good.
You're so fucking good!


01:31:52.120 --> 01:31:55.870
You're just like her!
You're all just fucking like her!


01:31:55.950 --> 01:31:58.200
You wanna drive a man
fucking crazy,


01:31:58.290 --> 01:32:00.790
then go ahead,
until you go out of your fucking mind!


01:32:00.920 --> 01:32:03.880
Then go-- Go on
your fucking way!


01:32:03.960 --> 01:32:07.090
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!


01:32:07.210 --> 01:32:08.630
Go!


01:32:13.510 --> 01:32:15.140
You're right.


01:32:15.260 --> 01:32:16.970
You're right, Hayley.


01:32:17.100 --> 01:32:19.640
Thank you. Thank you.


01:32:20.810 --> 01:32:21.980
This is me.


01:32:22.100 --> 01:32:24.690
This is who I am.


01:32:24.770 --> 01:32:26.110
Thank you.


01:32:26.230 --> 01:32:27.940
Thank you for
helping me see it.


01:33:19.410 --> 01:33:20.830
What took you so long?


01:33:20.950 --> 01:33:23.460
- You dropped this.
- I had to.


01:33:23.580 --> 01:33:25.460
- Yeah?
- You would have been down there forever.


01:33:25.540 --> 01:33:26.580
Were you jerkin' off?


01:33:26.670 --> 01:33:29.210
Which do you wanna fuck first,
me or the knife?


01:33:30.170 --> 01:33:34.220
- You know how to use that?
- Honor student, remember?


01:33:34.340 --> 01:33:37.050
Nothing I can't do
when I put my mind to it.


01:33:42.390 --> 01:33:44.520
Toss the knife in the backyard!


01:33:44.640 --> 01:33:45.560
Why?


01:33:45.690 --> 01:33:47.810
Or you'll shoot again?
Go on, shoot me.


01:33:47.900 --> 01:33:49.360
You're not gonna shoot me!


01:33:49.480 --> 01:33:52.740
It's not me you have to worry about.
It's Janelle.


01:33:54.280 --> 01:33:55.410
I called her.


01:33:55.530 --> 01:33:59.870
Told her I was Lieutenant Hayley
from the L.A.P.D.


01:33:59.990 --> 01:34:01.790
How far does she live, Jeff?


01:34:04.210 --> 01:34:05.540
Look over there.


01:34:06.540 --> 01:34:08.250
Look over there!


01:34:13.380 --> 01:34:16.590
The deal's still open.


01:34:16.720 --> 01:34:20.470
You put the noose around your neck,
you end this whole game.


01:34:20.560 --> 01:34:25.100
I will still clean up all the evidence.
You're running out of time!


01:34:26.350 --> 01:34:28.190
Or we can wait for her.


01:34:30.070 --> 01:34:32.860
I'll pull off my clothes,


01:34:32.940 --> 01:34:36.240
and I will run into her arms.


01:34:36.360 --> 01:34:38.240
What? Unless I hang myself?


01:34:42.040 --> 01:34:44.040
I'll find you.
I'll track you down!


01:34:44.120 --> 01:34:46.040
Assuming you knew anything about me.


01:34:46.120 --> 01:34:49.170
Calabasas girl who's dad teaches
at UCW shouldn't be that hard to find.


01:34:49.250 --> 01:34:52.210
You believed all that, huh?


01:34:56.220 --> 01:34:57.630
Who are you?


01:34:58.760 --> 01:35:00.600
It's hard to say for sure.


01:35:02.600 --> 01:35:05.060
Maybe not a Calabasas girl.


01:35:05.180 --> 01:35:07.520
Maybe not the daughter
of a med school professor.


01:35:07.600 --> 01:35:11.440
- Maybe not even a friend of Donna Mauer.
- Maybe not even named Hayley.


01:35:16.610 --> 01:35:18.950
Who the hell are you?


01:35:21.570 --> 01:35:25.120
I am every little girl
you ever watched...


01:35:26.120 --> 01:35:28.960
touched, hurt,


01:35:29.040 --> 01:35:32.090
screwed, killed.


01:35:49.690 --> 01:35:51.730
- She's gonna find it, Jeff.
- No.


01:35:51.810 --> 01:35:56.780
She's gonna find it all. Put on the noose
and jump and I'll stop it.


01:35:59.110 --> 01:36:00.950
She'll never find out.


01:36:02.030 --> 01:36:04.620
She'll just think you were
some sad man


01:36:04.700 --> 01:36:06.290
who she never
should have left.


01:36:09.160 --> 01:36:10.170
Jeff?


01:36:17.420 --> 01:36:19.630
Bad things--


01:36:19.720 --> 01:36:22.010
Fucking awful things
will happen to you in prison.


01:36:22.090 --> 01:36:27.720
This is the only way. You'll wish you'd killed
yourself when you had the chance.


01:36:28.770 --> 01:36:30.690
It's the only way, Jeff.


01:36:38.650 --> 01:36:39.610
Jeff!


01:36:56.540 --> 01:36:59.210
I didn't kill her.


01:37:03.050 --> 01:37:05.100
I just watched.


01:37:07.350 --> 01:37:09.850
I wanted to take pictures...


01:37:11.100 --> 01:37:12.770
but he wouldn't let me.


01:37:13.810 --> 01:37:15.360
It was me and another guy.


01:37:16.610 --> 01:37:18.650
I didn't do it.
I swear.


01:37:18.730 --> 01:37:20.320
I'll tell you the name,


01:37:20.400 --> 01:37:22.900
and I'll help you find him.


01:37:22.990 --> 01:37:24.740
I'll help you find him.


01:37:28.740 --> 01:37:30.330
I know his name.


01:37:31.410 --> 01:37:34.330
I know his name, Jeff.


01:37:37.420 --> 01:37:39.750
You know what's funny?


01:37:44.430 --> 01:37:45.430
Jeff?


01:37:47.600 --> 01:37:50.850
Aaron told me you did it
before he killed himself.


01:37:56.440 --> 01:37:58.440
It was him.
It wasn't me.


01:37:59.860 --> 01:38:00.820
Jeff.


01:38:02.740 --> 01:38:05.610
I don't care.


01:38:13.790 --> 01:38:16.290
Jeff?


01:39:05.220 --> 01:39:07.970
Don't worry.


01:39:08.050 --> 01:39:11.140
I promise I'll take care of it all.


01:39:41.040 --> 01:39:44.630
Or not.

